Package: algorithm.viewer
Type: Package
Title: Algorithm Viewer - Shiny Application for Visualizing Prediction Algorithms
Version: 0.1.3
Date: 2026-04-20
Description: A Shiny web application for visualizing prediction algorithms.
  Allows users to upload algorithm configurations, select models, adjust
  reference groups, and interactively explore predictor relationships.
